{"title":"Amazon’s Robotic Revolution","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/921108974/0/marginalrevolution~Amazons-Robotic-Revolution.html","date":1751541747000,"content":"<p>Amazon now employs almost as many robots as humans leading to huge productivity improvements. From the second graph, “end-to-end” packages handled by Amazon rose from 175 in 2015 to nearly 4000 in 2025. Incredible. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.wsj.com/tech/amazon-warehouse-robots-automation-942b814f?mod=hp_lead_pos7\">Excellent piece</a> in the WSJ.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Amazon-1.png\" width=\"755\" height=\"475\" srcset=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Amazon-1.png 755w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Amazon-1-300x189.png 300w\" /></p>\r\n<p>Hat tip: <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.edwardconard.com/\">Edward Conard</a>.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/07/amazons-robotic-revolution.html\">Amazon’s Robotic Revolution</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/921108974/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/921108974/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/921108974/marginalrevolution,https%3a%2f%2fmarginalrevolution.com%2fwp-content%2fuploads%2f2025%2f07%2fAmazon-1.png\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/921108974/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.c